msgctxt "92"
msgid "(That looks like Batsu, the hitman...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "What are you doing!?"
msgstr "Che stai facendo!?"

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's your own damn fault for joining the yakuza. Now it's\r\n"
"time for you to pay the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about!?"
msgstr "Ma che diavolo stai dicendo!?"

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Hold it right there. That's enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Who the hell are you?"
msgstr "Chi diavolo sei tu?"

msgctxt "164"
msgid "You're Batsu, the hitman, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "What if I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Hey. I'll take care of this. Get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Thank you! I'll never forget this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "You in the biz, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Not anymore. Why? Would you kill me if I were?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Yeah. That's right. The yakuza have to be destroyed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "That's extreme. What do you have against the yakuza, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"If you side with them, you're just as guilty as they are!\r\n"
"You deserve to die, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Looks like talking isn't gonna get us anywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Pay for your sins, yakuza scum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2884"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2888"
msgid "Terrified Yakuza"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2892"
msgid "Batsu"
msgstr ""
